OL,3,APrince William wants more protection
OL,4,Afrom harassment for service women
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince of Wales says more must be
OL,7,Fdone to ensure that women in the armed
OL,8,Fforces are shown respect and protected
OL,9,Ffrom sexual harassment.
OL,11,FPrince William has called for a
OL,12,Fmilitary culture that is more inclusive
OL,13,Fand respectful of women - and has
OL,14,Fwarned that at present those values are
OL,15,Fnot always being met.
OL,17,FThe prince, who will one day be head of
OL,18,Fthe armed forces, held private meetings
OL,19,Fwith service women for an article he
OL,20,Fhas produced as guest editor of Country
OL,21,FLife magazine.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
